{"seq":2,"slug":"bisect-and-blame","title":"二分法与追溯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/bisect-and-blame","wordCount":690,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"二分法与追溯\">二分法与追溯</h1><h2 id=\"git-bisect-二分查找\">Git Bisect 二分查找</h2><p><strong>git bisect</strong> 使用二分查找算法，在提交历史中快速定位引入 bug 的精确提交。对于数百甚至数千个提交的范围，bisect 将搜索次数降低到 <strong>O(log n)</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git bisect start&#10;git bisect bad HEAD&#10;git bisect good v1.0.0&#10;&#10;# Git 自动检出中间点&#10;# 测试后标记&#10;git bisect good&#10;# 或&#10;git bisect bad&#10;&#10;# 找到后重置&#10;git bisect reset\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bad</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> good</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v1.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Git 自动检出中间点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 测试后标记</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> good</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bad</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 找到后重置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reset</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[good: v1.0] --&gt; B[...] --&gt; C[...] --&gt; D[...] --&gt; E[bad: HEAD]&#10;    C --&gt;|bisect 检出| F{测试}&#10;    F --&gt;|good| G[搜索右半部分]&#10;    F --&gt;|bad| H[搜索左半部分]\">graph LR\n    A[good: v1.0] --&gt; B[...] --&gt; C[...] --&gt; D[...] --&gt; E[bad: HEAD]\n    C --&gt;|bisect 检出| F{测试}\n    F --&gt;|good| G[搜索右半部分]\n    F --&gt;|bad| H[搜索左半部分]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>&quot;代码考古&quot;是一组在历史中定位信息的工具，每个工具回答一个不同的问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Bisect</td>\n<td>二分查找定位引入 bug 的提交，复杂度 O(log n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blame</td>\n<td>逐行显示最后一次修改该行的提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Log 检索</td>\n<td>用 -S / -G 在提交差异中搜索字符串或正则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reflog</td>\n<td>记录 HEAD 与分支引用的每次移动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退出码</td>\n<td>bisect run 中脚本返回 good/bad/skip 的约定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"bisect-自动化\">Bisect 自动化</h2><p>配合测试脚本实现完全自动化的 bug 定位：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git bisect start HEAD v1.0.0&#10;git bisect run ./test-script.sh\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v1.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./test-script.sh</span></span></code></pre></div><p>测试脚本需要遵循退出码约定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>退出码</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>当前提交是 good</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1-124</td>\n<td>当前提交是 bad</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>125</td>\n<td>跳过该提交（无法测试）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>126-127</td>\n<td>bisect 异常终止</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/bin/bash&#10;make build &amp;&amp; ./run-tests.sh\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./run-tests.sh</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git bisect start HEAD v1.0.0&#10;git bisect run bash -c &#39;grep -q &quot;expected_output&quot; &lt;(./my-program)&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v1.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bash</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'grep -q \"expected_output\" &#x3C;(./my-program)'</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 自动化 bisect 是定位回归 bug 的终极武器。编写一个返回正确退出码的测试脚本，Git 就能在几分钟内从上千个提交中找到罪魁祸首。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"bisect-日志与可视化\">Bisect 日志与可视化</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git bisect log&#10;git bisect log &gt; bisect-log.txt&#10;git bisect replay bisect-log.txt&#10;&#10;git bisect visualize&#10;git bisect visualize --oneline\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect-log.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> replay</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect-log.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> visualize</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> visualize</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --oneline</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"git-blame-追溯\">Git Blame 追溯</h2><p><strong>git blame</strong> 显示文件中每一行最后一次被修改的提交信息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git blame src/config.sh&#10;&#10;git blame -L 10,20 src/config.sh&#10;&#10;git blame -w src/config.sh&#10;&#10;git blame -C src/config.sh&#10;&#10;git blame -C -C -C src/config.sh\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> blame</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> blame</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -L</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 10,20</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> blame</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> blame</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -C</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> blame</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -C</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -C</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -C</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>-L m,n</code></td>\n<td>只显示第 m 到 n 行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-w</code></td>\n<td>忽略空白字符变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-C</code></td>\n<td>检测文件内的代码移动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-C -C</code></td>\n<td>检测跨文件的代码移动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-C -C -C</code></td>\n<td>检测文件创建时的代码复制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--since</code></td>\n<td>只显示指定日期后的更改</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git blame --since=&quot;2025-01-01&quot; src/config.sh\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> blame</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --since=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2025-01-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"git-log-高级查询\">Git Log 高级查询</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git log --oneline --graph --all&#10;&#10;git log --author=&quot;alice&quot; --since=&quot;2025-01-01&quot; --until=&quot;2025-06-01&quot;&#10;&#10;git log -S &quot;function_name&quot;&#10;&#10;git log -G &quot;regex_pattern&quot;&#10;&#10;git log -- src/config.sh&#10;&#10;git log --follow -- src/config.sh\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --oneline</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --graph</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --all</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --author=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --since=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2025-01-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --until=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2025-06-01\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -S</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"function_name\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -G</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"regex_pattern\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --follow</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>-S string</code></td>\n<td>搜索添加/删除了指定字符串的提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-G regex</code></td>\n<td>搜索差异中匹配正则的提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--follow</code></td>\n<td>追踪文件重命名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--all</code></td>\n<td>包含所有分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--merges</code></td>\n<td>只显示合并提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--no-merges</code></td>\n<td>排除合并提交</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"git-reflog-引用日志\">Git Reflog 引用日志</h2><p><strong>Reflog（引用日志）</strong> 记录了 HEAD 和分支引用的每一次移动，是恢复误操作的最后防线。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git reflog&#10;&#10;git reflog show feature/login&#10;&#10;git diff HEAD@{0} HEAD@{3}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reflog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reflog</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> show</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/login</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD@{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD@{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;HEAD@{0}: commit: feat X&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;HEAD@{1}: rebase: squash&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;HEAD@{2}: checkout: from main&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;HEAD@{3}: commit: fix Y&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;HEAD@{4}: pull: merge&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"HEAD@{0}: commit: feat X\"] --&gt; B[\"HEAD@{1}: rebase: squash\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"HEAD@{2}: checkout: from main\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"HEAD@{3}: commit: fix Y\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"HEAD@{4}: pull: merge\"]</pre><p>恢复误操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git reset --hard HEAD@{2}&#10;&#10;git checkout -b recovered HEAD@{5}&#10;&#10;git cherry-pick HEAD@{3}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reset</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --hard</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD@{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> recovered</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD@{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cherry-pick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD@{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> reflog 条目默认保留 90 天（可达对象）或 30 天（不可达对象）。在执行危险操作前，先用 <code>git reflog</code> 记录当前状态，确保有回退路径。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"组合使用\">组合使用</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 场景：定位某行代码何时被修改&#10;git blame -L 42,42 src/config.sh&#10;# 获取 commit hash 后查看完整变更&#10;git show &lt;commit-hash&gt;&#10;&#10;# 场景：找到删除某函数的提交&#10;git log -S &quot;parse_config&quot; --oneline&#10;&#10;# 场景：自动定位回归 bug&#10;git bisect start HEAD v2.0.0&#10;git bisect run make test\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 场景：定位某行代码何时被修改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> blame</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -L</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 42,42</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 获取 commit hash 后查看完整变更</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> show</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">commit-has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">h</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 场景：找到删除某函数的提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -S</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"parse_config\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --oneline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 场景：自动定位回归 bug</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v2.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bisect</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> make</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((二分法与追溯))&#10;    Bisect&#10;      二分查找 bug&#10;      自动化脚本&#10;      O&amp;#40;log n&amp;#41; 效率&#10;    Blame&#10;      逐行追溯&#10;      -C 跨文件追踪&#10;      -w 忽略空白&#10;    Log&#10;      -S 字符串搜索&#10;      -G 正则搜索&#10;      --follow 追踪重命名&#10;    Reflog&#10;      HEAD 移动记录&#10;      误操作恢复&#10;      最后防线\">mindmap\n  root((二分法与追溯))\n    Bisect\n      二分查找 bug\n      自动化脚本\n      O&amp;#40;log n&amp;#41; 效率\n    Blame\n      逐行追溯\n      -C 跨文件追踪\n      -w 忽略空白\n    Log\n      -S 字符串搜索\n      -G 正则搜索\n      --follow 追踪重命名\n    Reflog\n      HEAD 移动记录\n      误操作恢复\n      最后防线</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Bisect</strong> 利用二分查找在 O(log n) 时间内定位引入 bug 的提交，配合脚本可完全自动化</li>\n<li><strong>Blame</strong> 追溯每一行代码的最后修改者和时间，<code>-C</code> 选项可跨文件追踪代码移动</li>\n<li><strong>Log</strong> 的 <code>-S</code> 和 <code>-G</code> 选项是搜索代码变更历史的利器</li>\n<li><strong>Reflog</strong> 记录 HEAD 的每次移动，是恢复误操作（如错误的 reset、rebase）的最后防线</li>\n<li>组合使用这些工具形成完整的<strong>代码考古</strong>工作流</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"二分法与追溯","id":"二分法与追溯"},{"level":2,"text":"Git Bisect 二分查找","id":"git-bisect-二分查找"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Bisect 自动化","id":"bisect-自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"Bisect 日志与可视化","id":"bisect-日志与可视化"},{"level":2,"text":"Git Blame 追溯","id":"git-blame-追溯"},{"level":2,"text":"Git Log 高级查询","id":"git-log-高级查询"},{"level":2,"text":"Git Reflog 引用日志","id":"git-reflog-引用日志"},{"level":2,"text":"组合使用","id":"组合使用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"交互式变基","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/interactive-rebase"},"next":{"title":"精选与回退","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/cherry-pick-and-revert"}}